&GLOBAL
  PRINT_LEVEL LOW
  PROJECT f6fix_27_C3H6_c5_r12
  RUN_TYPE ENERGY
&END GLOBAL
&FORCE_EVAL
  METHOD QUICKSTEP
  &DFT
